1211
00:55:41,405 --> 00:55:43,040
You've got everything
a girl needs.

1212
00:55:43,040 --> 00:55:45,743
- I got a pig when I was eight.
- And you got me, Suzy.

1213
00:55:45,743 --> 00:55:47,412
- You got a lot of hair
