anyone now?

1238
00:56:56,782 --> 00:56:58,783
- Maybe I'd better look
around for another job.

1239
00:56:58,783 --> 00:57:01,152
Until you open up again.

1240
00:57:01,152 --> 00:57:02,387
- Yeah, well, I
don't know, Joe.

1241
00:57:02,387 --> 00:57:04,522
Maybe we'll open in a few days.

1242
00:57:04,522 --> 00:57:06,190
Who knows?

1243
00:57:06,190 --> 00:57:09,027
Anyway, stick around, relax.
Make yourself at home.

1244
00:57:09,027 --> 00:57:10,362
